sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as You
    participant W as Watch app
    participant C as ResponseCache
    participant P as Proxy
    participant A as Your PWA
    U->>W: Tap "Demo Tasks"
    W->>C: Cached copy + ETag?
    C-->>W: (maybe) ETag "abc"
    W->>P: GET /api/v1/apps/demo/screens/home<br/>x-bridge-key, If-None-Match: "abc"
    P->>A: GET /demo/watch.json (cached 5 min)
    P->>A: GET /demo/api/tasks (cached ttl)
    A-->>P: { tasks: [...], open: 2 }
    P->>P: template → sanitize → JSON → ETag
    alt same as watch's copy
        P-->>W: 304 Not Modified (empty body)
        W->>C: use cached document
    else changed
        P-->>W: 200 WatchUI document + new ETag
        W->>C: save document + ETag
    end
    W-->>U: Native SwiftUI list
